## Rules for Agents

- Do **not** create or update files under `tasks/` — that folder was removed.
- Put the full acceptance criteria and spec in the issue body. Do not add a Story Status or task Status column — use the project **Status** field.
- Link child tasks to their parent story issue in the **Story** project field and in the task body.
- After completing a story, update [`docs/DEVELOPMENT_HISTORY.md`](../../docs/DEVELOPMENT_HISTORY.md) if the roadmap changed.
